<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>news.briefer.reconfirm</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/usr/bin/python3</string>
    <string>/Users/maxgoshay/code/briefernewsapp/scripts/reconfirm_pending.py</string>
    <string>--since</string>
    <string>2026-06-10</string>
    <string>--limit</string>
    <string>30</string>
  </array>

  <!-- DISABLED 2026-08-03. Unloaded live and pinned off here so a future
       `make agents-install` cannot resurrect it.

       WHY: this was built to rescue what looked like a 724-signup backlog. It
       is now clear that backlog was an injected list, not subscribers. 724
       "signups" arrived in one week against ~60 real daily visitors, as a
       steady 5-12/hour drip around the clock, and only 6 ever confirmed
       (0.8%; genuine double opt-in runs 40-70%). They never confirm because
       they never subscribed. The drip stopped dead the day after the
       Turnstile widget shipped (2026-06-30), which is the tell.

       So this job was mailing ~718 people who never opted in, 30/day. That is
       an unsolicited-mail complaint vector aimed at our own SES reputation,
       with no upside: while it ran, unsubscribes went 4 -> 7 and bounces
       50 -> 54. The script's own 5% bounce-rate abort does not help here,
       because complaints, not bounces, are what get sending suspended.

       Do NOT re-enable against the pending pool. If a genuine re-confirmation
       need ever arises, scope it to addresses that actually confirmed.

       Original note: drained the backlog in 30/day batches; skips anyone
       already nudged and aborts a batch above a 5% SES bounce rate. -->
  <key>Disabled</key>
  <true/>

  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key><integer>10</integer>
    <key>Minute</key><integer>30</integer>
  </dict>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/maxgoshay/code/briefernewsapp/logs/reconfirm-launchagent.out</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/maxgoshay/code/briefernewsapp/logs/reconfirm-launchagent.err</string>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/maxgoshay/code/briefernewsapp</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/Users/maxgoshay/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/maxgoshay</string>
  </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
